            "value": "This account hasn't acquired the app yet. Get it once, then the full version list appears."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此账号还没有获取这个应用。先获取一次，之后就能查看完整版本列表。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此帳號還沒有取得這個應用。先取得一次，之後就能檢視完整版本列表。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
